{"des":"奇瓦-关于荒野客","script":"yd_019_09","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a","x":100,"y":-423.20000000000005,"img":"chara019_1","scaleY":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a","transTime":300,"x":100,"y":-423.20000000000005,"img":"chara019_1","scaleY":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]我有没有和你说过？其实我也被荒野客打劫过！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]真是不敢相信，面对软软这么大的火元素，[r]那些拿着破铜烂铁、衣衫褴褛的家伙居然也敢就那样冲上来呢！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]宁愿向着明显比自己更强的敌人冲锋，也绝不愿意用自己的劳动来换取生存，[r]这些人的疯狂，真的是让我大吃一惊！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]不过，能够批量培养出这种疯子的深渊，也确实是一个挺……残酷的地方。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]在大书院的时候我还没什么感受，实际出来之后……希望总有一天，深渊能够变得更好吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}